        "text": "According to Verizon Communications Inc. (Petitioner), according to Verizon Communications Inc. (Petitioner), verizon argues that the Court has never recognized a Section\u202f2 duty for a monopolist to turn over its sales to rivals at specially discounted prices, i.e., a duty to dismantle itself."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "5cf32219d7b3d8e962bc2efc3a4893be9adf8c3f6310b8a77f5163de0b1db9ac",
