            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 6,
              "start": 6
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court states that there is no Section\u202f2 duty on the merits to turn over sales to a rival, noting that Section\u202f2 does not condemn mere size and does not compel competition."
      }
